#Bash zu MCS Wrapper

## Bash starts

alias #!/bin/bash='#!MCS'
alias #='#'


## Proteine

alias »='»*«'
alias []='['*'|*|*|*|*|*]'
alias []='['*'|*|'*'|*|'*'|*]'
alias []='['*'|*|*|*|*]'
alias []='['*'|*|*|*]'
alias []='['*'|*|'*'|*]'
alias []='['*'|*|*]'
alias []='['*'|*]'



## Protone

alias {}='{'*'|*}'
alias {}='{'*'|*|*}'
alias {}='{'*'|*|'*'|*}'
alias {}='{'*'|*|*|*}'


## Sonstiges
alias cd='to'
alias source='puls'

